        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 Society of Cardiovascular Computed Tomography. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Coronary angiography demonstrated an occluded stent outside the lumen in the right coronary artery of a patient presenting with an acute coronary syndrome. Computed tomography confirmed the extraluminal location of the occluded stent. This finding is likely due to deployment of the stent in a dissection plane."
      },
